start presence uses inverse-frequency binary weights. The final fine-tuning objective is
\begin{equation}
 \mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{fine}}=\sum_{k=1}^{6}\lambda_k\mathcal{L}_k,\qquad \lambda_k\equiv1,
 \label{eq:multitask_loss}
\end{equation}
where the six tasks follow the order listed above. The outer coefficients are fixed; class weights and masks remain inside each loss.
